00:41:17.170 --> 00:41:18.750
And they had some theories of their own.
他们有自己的理论。

871
00:41:19.190 --> 00:41:28.310
Well, Anna White said she thinks Jim gives the phone to Pam so that Pam can get Andy's cell phone number off the phone in the first place.
安娜·怀特说她认为吉姆把手机给帕姆，是为了让帕姆先从手机里获取安迪的号码。

872
00:41:28.310 --> 00:41:30.230
Because how else would Jim know?
因为不然吉姆怎么会知道呢？

873
00:41:30.650 --> 00:41:37.130
She thinks Pam probably emails Jim the number so that he can start calling it after he puts it in the ceiling.
她认为帕姆可能把号码发邮件给了吉姆，这样他把手机放进天花板后就可以开始拨打那个号码了。

874
00:41:37.130 --> 00:41:37.950
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

875
00:41:38.350 --> 00:41:38.830
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

876
00:41:39.110 --> 00:41:44.990
Well, my one thought is Andy is the type of guy that gave every single person his cell phone number the first day.
嗯，我的想法是，安迪那种人第一天就会把手机号给每个人。

877
00:41:46.310 --> 00:41:48.310
But that doesn't mean they saved it.
但这并不意味着他们都存了。

878
00:41:48.550 --> 00:41:49.370
That's true.
那倒是。

879
00:41:49.530 --> 00:41:50.010
That's true.
那倒是。

880
00:41:50.010 --> 00:41:54.430
But I just have this feeling that Andy has texted Jim like, what up, my dog?
但我总觉得安迪会给吉姆发短信说，嘿，哥们，最近怎么样？

881
00:41:54.870 --> 00:41:55.450
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

882
00:41:55.710 --> 00:41:56.730
Want to meet me for a beer?
想出来喝杯啤酒吗？

883
00:41:56.850 --> 00:41:57.270
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

884
00:41:57.510 --> 00:41:58.150
You're going to answer?
你要回吗？

885
00:41:58.290 --> 00:41:58.630
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

886
00:41:59.010 --> 00:42:01.070
Look at this crazy thing I saw on the Internet.
看看我在网上看到的这个疯狂的东西。

887
00:42:01.290 --> 00:42:01.670
Big tuna.
大金枪鱼。

888
00:42:01.910 --> 00:42:03.470
Well, I like these theories.
嗯，我喜欢这些理论。

